<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Harvest raises half yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Harvest raises half yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     18.6	vs     13.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 14.0	vs     12.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.45	vs     2.49</p>
<p>    After tax		 3.76	vs     2.28</p>
<p>Div payable October 11</p>
<p>on register September 27</p>
<p>Full name: Harvest Securities Ltd (investment trust)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
